# ============================================================
# 天保星君 - Git Ignore
# 策略：仅推送 program/ 目录下的源代码，排除所有产品资料
# ============================================================

# === TRAE & IDE ===
.trae/
.uploads/
.trae-html-share-packages/
.vscode/
.idea/

# === OS ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# === 排除根目录下所有文件和目录（产品资料、报告、文档等）===
/*

# === 仅保留代码目录和必要配置 ===
!/program/
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# === program/ 目录内的排除项 ===
# 构建产物
program/**/node_modules/
program/**/target/
program/**/dist/
program/**/build/
program/**/.gradle/
program/**/*.class

# 环境配置
program/**/.env
program/**/.env.local
program/**/.env.*.local

# IDE 缓存
program/**/.vscode/
program/**/.idea/
program/**/*.iml

# 日志
program/**/*.log
program/**/*.err

# 编译产物
program/**/*.exe
program/**/*.dll

# 产品资料（program 目录内）
program/卡片背景资料/

# === 通用排除 ===
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
*.7z
